From 95c344f84eb73cb02d685107b51d6a84a001abc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 08:58:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add fulfillment queue, TikTok lead round robin, and richer
 live analytics

- Analytics: live visitor table shows the customer's actual name (from
  their linked cart) or "Team: <name>" instead of a bare "Known customer"
  label, and shows cart product names instead of just an item count.
- Fulfillment: new orders.ready_to_prepare_at/_by columns and a
  superadmin-only Fulfillment tab. An agent marks a paid order "ready to
  prepare", which pings the owner's WhatsApp and an in-app notification;
  the order drops off the queue once it reaches Order Complete, reusing
  the existing shipped-notification flow.
- TikTok leads: new leads now rotate between Pollita, Dani and Korinne
  instead of always going to one fixed agent, with a WhatsApp ping to
  whoever gets picked. A contact who already owns a CRM lead keeps that
  owner rather than being reshuffled on a repeat form submission.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VG1FtmjgdA8HYDRxZmEwny
